### Get all categories
GET {{baseUrl}}?search=talif&orderBy=name&orderType=asc&page=1&perPage=4
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Get category by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/42d1020e-6951-45b2-b2a3-da75fc5f8db1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Delete category by ID
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/42d1020e-6951-45b2-b2a3-da75fc5f8db1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}


### Create new category
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessTokenSuperAdmin}}

{
    "name": "test",
    "icon": "test",
    "status": true,
    "slug": "test",
    "description": "test"
}